---
description: Zod schemas by domain; shared pieces; field errors via zodErrorToFieldErrors
globs: src/validation/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Validation (`src/validation`)

- Colocate schemas under **`src/validation/<domain>/`** (e.g. `event/`). Export public schemas from **`index.ts`** for clean imports in services.
- Prefer **small reusable helpers** in a `shared/` subfolder (e.g. optional trimmed string, currency) and compose them in `create*InputSchema` / `update*InputSchema`.
- Parse with **`safeParse`** in services; convert failures with **`zodErrorToFieldErrors`** so HTTP layer gets a **`Record<string, string>`**.
- Param schemas (e.g. **`eventIdParamSchema`**) live next to body schemas; services own parsing **`pathParameters`**-derived values when validating IDs.

Do not parse or validate request bodies in Zod inside handlers — keep handlers thin (see lambda-http-handlers rule).
